      "id": "p0161-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In 1994, Capcom released a Super Famicom role-playing game known as Breath of Fire II in Japan. A North American version was released in 1995, and a European version was released in 1996. Although it boasts solid game design and a memorable story, Breath of Fire II has also earned notoriety for its poor English-language localization.",
        "raw": "In 1994, Capcom released a Super Famicom role-playing game known as\nBreath of Fire II in Japan. A North American version was released in 1995,\nand a European version was released in 1996. Although it boasts solid\ngame design and a memorable story, Breath of Fire II has also earned\nnotoriety for its poor English-language localization.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
